1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Ninth Episode
Mr. X

15
00:02:04,901 --> 00:02:08,860
The army of Union X marches
toward the border of Silverland.

16
00:02:09,221 --> 00:02:11,610
Its soldiers advance
destroying everything:

17
00:02:11,661 --> 00:02:13,652
mountains, forests, cities

18
00:02:13,941 --> 00:02:16,739
They carry with them
formidable and powerful weapons.

19
00:02:17,781 --> 00:02:22,172
The huge army of Union X
is just outside Silverland, now.

20
00:02:22,661 --> 00:02:26,700
The only obstacle placed in its
path is Satan's mountain.

21
00:02:27,661 --> 00:02:31,859
But they will raze it to the ground and then
they will attempt to invade Silverland.

22
00:02:37,181 --> 00:02:39,012
General, sir!

23
00:02:40,061 --> 00:02:42,256
General Ghana, sir, at your command!

24
00:02:42,301 --> 00:02:44,337
I come from Headquarters!
I am relaying the order to you...

25
00:02:44,381 --> 00:02:46,417
...to conquer
Satan's mountain..

26
00:02:46,461 --> 00:02:48,338
...before the bulk
of the troops arrive! - Very well!

27
00:02:48,381 --> 00:02:50,019
At your command, General!

28
00:02:51,261 --> 00:02:53,013
On the march!

29
00:03:04,501 --> 00:03:06,457
Shoot!

30
00:03:09,501 --> 00:03:12,015
Attack! Move out

31
00:03:16,541 --> 00:03:19,738
Why are they practicing
archery and the spear?

32
00:03:19,781 --> 00:03:23,330
To prevent the army
of Union X from invading Silverland.

33
00:03:23,381 --> 00:03:25,531
It is now not far
from our borders.

34
00:03:25,581 --> 00:03:27,458
They must practice every day.

35
00:03:27,501 --> 00:03:30,334
So there are bad people
even among human beings?

36
00:03:30,381 --> 00:03:34,499
Unfortunately yes, Zelda. There aren't
many, fortunately, but they do exist.

37
00:03:34,581 --> 00:03:38,893
But humans can love
others and be loved by them, right?

38
00:03:39,701 --> 00:03:41,657
Yes, exactly, that's right.

39
00:03:41,901 --> 00:03:44,540
Oh, then I envy
human beings!

40
00:03:44,581 --> 00:03:48,494
Zelda, there's no reason why you
can't care for people.

41
00:03:49,261 --> 00:03:52,617
I want to care for people!
To love!

42
00:03:53,141 --> 00:03:55,894
Princess, it's time for
the War Council!

43
00:03:56,261 --> 00:03:58,456
Unfortunately, duty calls

44
00:03:58,501 --> 00:04:00,492
- Will we see each other again, Sapphire?
- Yes.

45
00:04:00,541 --> 00:04:03,135
We'll see each other in the hawthorn
forest in a week.

46
00:04:03,181 --> 00:04:04,819
All right.

47
00:04:05,501 --> 00:04:08,015
Be careful!
The army of Union X..

48
00:04:08,061 --> 00:04:10,495
...might pass
in front of the mountain where you live

49
00:04:10,541 --> 00:04:12,532
Yes, but you be careful too!

50
00:04:38,461 --> 00:04:41,692
Sapphire said that I could love
someone like humans do.

51
00:05:13,141 --> 00:05:15,496
- Zelda!
- Mom! Dad!

52
00:05:15,661 --> 00:05:18,221
Tell me:
what were you thinking about?

53
00:05:19,021 --> 00:05:20,773
Well, I

54
00:05:20,861 --> 00:05:24,058
Listen, Zelda, it's no use
telling me lies.

55
00:05:24,101 --> 00:05:26,251
You know I can read your mind.

56
00:05:26,301 --> 00:05:29,020
You're interested in
human beings, aren't you?

57
00:05:30,901 --> 00:05:33,813
- Confess!
- No, mother!

58
00:05:34,581 --> 00:05:38,369
Don't lie to me! Don't you know what a
terrible punishment would be inflicted...

59
00:05:38,421 --> 00:05:40,935
...on a daughter of Satan if she
fell in love with a human being!

60
00:05:40,981 --> 00:05:43,620
It is so! Perhaps you don't know

61
00:05:43,661 --> 00:05:46,221
..the punishment of the Great
Devil. You tell her, darling.

62
00:05:46,501 --> 00:05:49,334
What is this punishment
of the Great Devil like?

63
00:05:50,261 --> 00:05:52,411
Listen carefully, Zelda.

64
00:05:52,461 --> 00:05:56,534
The punishment that the
Great Devil inflicts is so terrible...

65
00:06:06,821 --> 00:06:10,609
Did you understand, Zelda? You must
never be a bad daughter!

66
00:06:10,821 --> 00:06:13,176
I understand, mom and dad.

67
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:17,500
Good! Well done! Now we can go
to the Witches' Conference.

68
00:06:17,540 --> 00:06:21,090
- The Witches' Conference?!
- Yes, the Witches' Conference!

69
00:06:21,140 --> 00:06:24,611
Wait a second, dear!
Zelda, take this amulet.

70
00:06:24,660 --> 00:06:27,334
It will inform me immediately
if anything should happen to you.

71
00:06:27,380 --> 00:06:29,292
Take care of the house
while we are away.

72
00:06:29,340 --> 00:06:31,775
Be on your guard
against the evil humans!

73
00:06:34,140 --> 00:06:36,450
Bye, mom! Dad!

74
00:06:40,180 --> 00:06:43,173
General, it seems that
the Satans are moving away!

75
00:06:43,220 --> 00:06:46,179
Good! We will destroy the mountain!
Prepare the weapons!

76
00:06:56,420 --> 00:06:59,572
Zelda, you must always remember
that you are our daughter,

77
00:06:59,620 --> 00:07:01,373
the daughter of Satan!

78
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:03,616
You would receive a terrible punishment
from the Great Devil...

79
00:07:03,660 --> 00:07:05,936
..if you were to fall in love
with a human being.

80
00:07:09,020 --> 00:07:11,171
Oh, mom! But I...

81
00:07:14,540 --> 00:07:17,533
Good, we will destroy the mountain!
Prepare the weapons!

82
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:24,457
What is happening?

83
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:29,255
Forward, fire! We must raze
that mountain down there to the ground!

84
00:07:45,020 --> 00:07:47,012
- Who is this?
- She's a little girl!

85
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:49,017
She must be the daughter of Satan!

86
00:07:49,380 --> 00:07:52,134
- We have to kill her!
- Yes, let's burn her like a witch!

87
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:54,172
No, better to kill her with the sword!

88
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:57,258
- Help! Mommy! Daddy!
- Prepare to die, little girl!

89
00:07:57,300 --> 00:08:00,771
Wait! What are you doing?
Leave her alone!

90
00:08:01,020 --> 00:08:03,774
- General, she's the daughter of Satan!
- It's an order!

91
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:05,618
Yes sir, General Ghana!

92
00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:08,016
- What shall we do with her, General?
- I'll handle it.

93
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:10,620
I'll be responsible for her.
Leave her to me, for the moment.

94
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:12,253
But we can't take her with us!

95
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:14,292
I'll have to consult with Mr. X.

96
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:16,491
Until then,
no one will touch her! Clear?

97
00:08:21,900 --> 00:08:24,096
Come here! Let me see your arm!

98
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:27,019
But you're wounded! Bring
some disinfectant and a bandage!

99
00:08:27,060 --> 00:08:29,017
We must treat
this wound immediately.

100
00:08:35,580 --> 00:08:37,651
Prepare a horse for her! Immediately!

101
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:40,499
Now listen to me:
I have to take you to Mr. X,

102
00:08:40,540 --> 00:08:43,374
so follow me and don't play any tricks.
Do you understand, little girl?

103
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:45,333
Alright.

104
00:08:49,341 --> 00:08:51,571
May I know what your name is?

105
00:08:51,621 --> 00:08:55,170
- Yes, you can! My name is Zelda.
- You have a nice voice.

106
00:08:56,741 --> 00:09:01,212
- Zelda... It's a nice name.
- And what is your name?

107
00:09:04,021 --> 00:09:06,251
Me?... My name is Ghana.

108
00:09:07,021 --> 00:09:09,933
Are you ready? Let's go!

109
00:09:12,781 --> 00:09:15,011
I can't wait to get back home.

110
00:09:15,141 --> 00:09:18,019
I'm worried about
leaving Zelda alone.

111
00:09:19,501 --> 00:09:21,492
You shouldn't worry.

112
00:09:22,781 --> 00:09:25,341
Our daughter, by now,
is old enough.

113
00:09:26,101 --> 00:09:29,332
But what happened to our
house?! It's been wiped out!

114
00:09:31,541 --> 00:09:34,009
- Zelda!
- Someone must have kidnapped her!

115
00:09:37,661 --> 00:09:41,415
Look! There are tracks of many
people who passed through here!

116
00:09:41,461 --> 00:09:43,133
Let's follow them!

117
00:09:46,501 --> 00:09:50,130
Look, soldiers!
And Zelda is with them!

118
00:09:51,461 --> 00:09:53,417
I know what to do!

119
00:10:07,501 --> 00:10:09,412
What the hell is that?!

120
00:10:09,461 --> 00:10:11,656
- But it's the devil!
- Yes, it's Satan!

121
00:10:11,701 --> 00:10:14,010
Satan has come
to take revenge on us!

122
00:10:21,861 --> 00:10:23,738
Have you seen my power?

123
00:10:23,781 --> 00:10:27,251
I'll teach you another lesson,
if you don't give me back my daughter!

124
00:10:32,381 --> 00:10:34,133
What is it?

125
00:10:41,221 --> 00:10:45,339
You devil of a Satan,
I'm glad to see you

126
00:10:45,621 --> 00:10:47,293
Who are you?

127
00:10:47,781 --> 00:10:51,091
I am Mr. X,
a human Satan!

128
00:10:51,181 --> 00:10:54,810
I intend to build
an "Empire of Evil" on Earth,

129
00:10:54,901 --> 00:10:58,177
- just like you!
- An evil empire?!

130
00:10:59,221 --> 00:11:03,339
Exactly!
Let evil invade the world!

131
00:11:03,501 --> 00:11:07,096
As a first step, we
will conquer Silverland!

132
00:11:07,341 --> 00:11:10,538
What do you say, Satan?
Do you want to ally with me?

133
00:11:14,461 --> 00:11:18,295
His project interests me. If it's
true, I would be inclined to help him.

134
00:11:22,901 --> 00:11:25,461
Yes, it's interesting. We
could help you, but later!

135
00:11:25,501 --> 00:11:29,619
Right! After you've returned our
daughter Zelda to us, safe and sound!

136
00:11:30,541 --> 00:11:34,420
All right, I'll return her to
you, but on one condition!

137
00:11:35,461 --> 00:11:38,533
- What condition?
- On the condition that you capture..

138
00:11:38,581 --> 00:11:41,254
...the Princess of Silverland:
Zaffiro!

139
00:11:50,301 --> 00:11:53,338
Hello, little birds,
little inhabitants of the woods.

140
00:11:53,421 --> 00:11:57,130
And how are you, friends? It's been a long
time since we saw each other, hasn't it?

141
00:11:57,701 --> 00:12:00,579
You know, I came here because
today I have an appointment with Zelda.

142
00:12:00,621 --> 00:12:02,532
Right here, in this forest.

143
00:12:11,901 --> 00:12:13,812
What's happening? What...?

144
00:12:19,061 --> 00:12:22,098
Zaffiro! We must kidnap you
and take you to Lord X!

145
00:12:22,181 --> 00:12:25,457
- Oh, no, I don't want to!
- You cannot resist!

146
00:12:51,581 --> 00:12:55,130
What happened to me?
Ah, yes, I understand!

147
00:12:55,301 --> 00:12:58,611
I was taken by Satan
and brought to the Union X camp.

148
00:12:59,021 --> 00:13:01,455
Now I must think of how to escape
somehow!

149
00:13:06,541 --> 00:13:09,135
If the Princess escaped,
we would be killed.

150
00:13:17,941 --> 00:13:20,819
You've done a fine job, Satan!

151
00:13:21,461 --> 00:13:23,736
Now that Zaffiro
is in your hands,

152
00:13:23,781 --> 00:13:26,249
Silverland almost is as well,
don't you think?

153
00:13:26,301 --> 00:13:28,690
It's true. And I owe it to you!

154
00:13:32,381 --> 00:13:34,178
Zaffiro is here!

155
00:13:36,901 --> 00:13:38,698
I must save her!

156
00:13:42,061 --> 00:13:45,258
I believe that is the tent
where they are holding her prisoner.

157
00:13:45,941 --> 00:13:48,250
Who is behind me? Oh, you!

158
00:13:48,301 --> 00:13:51,373
Zelda, what are you doing here? You were
looking at Sapphire's tent, weren't you?

159
00:13:51,461 --> 00:13:55,090
Help her, please! She's my
friend! Please, Ghana, save her!

160
00:13:55,301 --> 00:13:59,374
I can't, Zelda! I'm sorry. I
am a soldier and I have orders.

161
00:13:59,461 --> 00:14:02,134
Even if your boss
is an evil man?

162
00:14:02,821 --> 00:14:06,336
Fine, Ghana! If you don't want
to help her, then I'll take care of it!

163
00:14:06,381 --> 00:14:08,212
Zelda, what are you saying?

164
00:14:08,341 --> 00:14:10,696
I'd like to stop you,
but I can't.

165
00:14:17,261 --> 00:14:20,298
Zelda!
Stay here, I'll take care of it!

166
00:14:33,581 --> 00:14:36,618
- Zelda!
- Shut up! Details later!

167
00:14:36,661 --> 00:14:38,413
Hurry up, quick!

168
00:14:48,261 --> 00:14:50,013
This way, Sapphire!

169
00:14:52,181 --> 00:14:55,093
Alarm!
The prisoner is escaping!

170
00:14:55,341 --> 00:14:57,616
- Stop!
- Catch them!

171
00:14:58,341 --> 00:15:01,458
Damn! We have to do
something, or they'll catch us!

172
00:15:07,621 --> 00:15:09,373
Fine!

173
00:15:10,141 --> 00:15:12,735
I won't let you pass!
You'll have to kill me!

174
00:15:12,781 --> 00:15:15,011
You're a traitor, General Ghana!

175
00:15:15,061 --> 00:15:17,017
Death to the traitor!

176
00:15:18,061 --> 00:15:19,813
Run, Zelda!

177
00:15:20,901 --> 00:15:24,052
If we could reach
the Black Forest, we'd be safe!

178
00:15:24,101 --> 00:15:26,740
I wonder if Ghana managed
to save himself...!

179
00:15:29,981 --> 00:15:33,735
What?! Ghana let
Sapphire escape? Damn it!

180
00:15:33,821 --> 00:15:37,097
What are you waiting for?
Get her now!

181
00:15:39,621 --> 00:15:41,612
It's useless!
It's too late now.

182
00:15:41,661 --> 00:15:43,413
At this point,
there's nothing left to do!

183
00:15:43,461 --> 00:15:45,099
You can't catch her again!

184
00:15:45,141 --> 00:15:47,735
Mr. X, with the prisoner
there was also Satan's daughter,

185
00:15:47,781 --> 00:15:50,818
- who helped her escape.
- What is this I hear?!

186
00:15:50,861 --> 00:15:52,613
She dared to do this?!

187
00:15:54,221 --> 00:15:57,258
Satan, it seems that you
have corrupted Ghana!

188
00:15:57,301 --> 00:16:00,816
You must take care of it!
What do you intend to do, Satan?

189
00:16:05,501 --> 00:16:07,492
Alright, I have an idea!

190
00:16:07,541 --> 00:16:09,657
Ghana will lead
us on their trail.

191
00:16:09,701 --> 00:16:13,091
I will bring Sapphire back.
Promise not to hinder us!

192
00:16:13,141 --> 00:16:15,291
We will take care of
settling the matter.

193
00:16:15,341 --> 00:16:17,730
Alright, I promise. Take Ghana!

194
00:16:17,781 --> 00:16:19,931
Remember: keep your word!

195
00:16:24,621 --> 00:16:27,658
I wonder if Zelda and
Sapphire will come to his aid.

196
00:16:27,701 --> 00:16:31,376
Don't worry! They are too
fond of him not to come.

197
00:16:31,421 --> 00:16:33,571
You'll see that my plan will work.

198
00:16:33,621 --> 00:16:35,851
Now I will let them
know that Ghana is here!

199
00:16:35,901 --> 00:16:40,019
Hail Satan!

200
00:16:43,781 --> 00:16:48,571
Hail Satan!

201
00:16:51,421 --> 00:16:53,810
Rest assured, they will
both come running here.

202
00:16:53,861 --> 00:16:57,410
- how kind-hearted they are!
- Why did you light that fire?

203
00:16:57,461 --> 00:17:00,578
Look up there!
The fire is bright..

204
00:17:00,621 --> 00:17:04,330
..and projects Ghana's image on
the smoke that rises into the sky.

205
00:17:08,221 --> 00:17:11,418
Look! Look, Sapphire!
Up there! See? It's Ghana!

206
00:17:11,461 --> 00:17:14,612
- What?!
- Ghana! Ghana!

207
00:17:16,221 --> 00:17:19,179
Ghana, I'm sorry...!
They've caught you, Ghana!

208
00:17:19,501 --> 00:17:24,052
Come on, Zelda! I think you really
like that young General, don't you?

209
00:17:24,541 --> 00:17:26,816
- Do you think you love him?
- Yes, but...

210
00:17:26,861 --> 00:17:28,817
If you love him, don't worry.

211
00:17:28,861 --> 00:17:32,137
Didn't I already tell you that even
a devil can love a human being?

212
00:17:32,341 --> 00:17:35,697
Let's go help him! It seems he's
on the other side of the mountain.

213
00:17:35,741 --> 00:17:37,618
- Let's hurry!
- Yes.

214
00:17:40,621 --> 00:17:43,897
There they are! These are
definitely Zelda and Sapphire!

215
00:17:43,941 --> 00:17:47,013
Let's stay hidden! I'm eager
to see what Zelda will do.

216
00:17:50,821 --> 00:17:52,891
Oh, Ghana! Ghana!

217
00:17:54,101 --> 00:17:55,898
I'm here!

218
00:17:57,421 --> 00:17:59,332
I'm coming, Ghana!

219
00:18:02,781 --> 00:18:04,260
Zelda!

220
00:18:05,301 --> 00:18:07,417
Have you regained consciousness, Ghana?

221
00:18:07,461 --> 00:18:10,533
Stay away from here, Zelda!
It's a trap! Go away, quickly!

222
00:18:12,341 --> 00:18:15,094
Don't be a fool, Ghana!
I'll help you!

223
00:18:15,141 --> 00:18:17,655
Come on, Zelda!
Climb a little higher!

224
00:18:18,021 --> 00:18:20,819
What are you doing,
Zelda? You are disobeying...

225
00:18:20,861 --> 00:18:23,534
...to all the advice
that your mother and I give you?

226
00:18:24,021 --> 00:18:27,411
- Mom! Dad!
- Get down from that tree right now!

227
00:18:27,461 --> 00:18:30,373
- Don't make me angry!
- Well, what are you waiting for?

228
00:18:31,341 --> 00:18:34,617
Yes, maybe..
it's better if you get down!

229
00:18:34,661 --> 00:18:37,778
Get down, Zelda! Leave me alone!
Forget about me!

230
00:18:38,421 --> 00:18:41,652
Ghana, I can't forget you!

231
00:18:42,461 --> 00:18:46,295
Mom! Dad! No, I can't do it!

232
00:18:46,341 --> 00:18:48,013
- What?!
- What?

233
00:18:48,061 --> 00:18:52,213
I'm sorry, Mom and Dad!
I feel like I have to help him.

234
00:18:52,741 --> 00:18:56,097
Zelda, don't do anything crazy!
Remember what awaits you..

235
00:18:56,141 --> 00:18:58,211
...if you fall in love
with a human being!

236
00:18:58,261 --> 00:19:00,297
Zelda, I made a promise
to Mr. X!

237
00:19:00,341 --> 00:19:02,297
Get down right now! I order you!

238
00:19:02,341 --> 00:19:04,172
If you made a deal with him,
remember...

239
00:19:04,221 --> 00:19:06,212
..that he's the last person in the world
who will keep his word!

240
00:19:06,261 --> 00:19:08,013
Look there!

241
00:19:19,341 --> 00:19:22,378
It looks like the right moment!
Are you ready to attack?

242
00:19:22,661 --> 00:19:24,333
Fire!

243
00:19:31,341 --> 00:19:33,491
Damn it, he betrayed us

244
00:19:38,901 --> 00:19:41,813
Zelda! We have to get Ghana down
as soon as possible!

245
00:19:42,101 --> 00:19:45,218
- Yes!
- Hurry! Be careful!

246
00:19:45,381 --> 00:19:49,169
- Zelda, are you alright?
- Yes! I'll free you in a moment!

247
00:19:49,421 --> 00:19:51,332
Thank you! Thank you, Zelda!

248
00:19:51,541 --> 00:19:54,009
What are you doing, Zelda!
Don't stay there! It's dangerous!

249
00:19:54,061 --> 00:19:56,017
- Get down!
- The cannons keep firing!

250
00:19:56,061 --> 00:19:58,291
They'll hit you! Get down!

251
00:19:59,061 --> 00:20:02,337
Damn them! I must try
at all costs to stop them!

252
00:20:02,381 --> 00:20:05,293
Great Devil, I appeal to you!
Come to my aid!

253
00:20:10,421 --> 00:20:12,810
You've made a mistake this time, Satan!

254
00:20:14,501 --> 00:20:16,651
If you go against X,

255
00:20:17,301 --> 00:20:20,532
it means you want to side
with Zelda,

256
00:20:21,021 --> 00:20:23,171
who loves a human being!

257
00:20:23,741 --> 00:20:26,301
If instead you want to defeat X,

258
00:20:26,461 --> 00:20:29,897
I'll have to punish you!
Do you understand?

259
00:20:30,341 --> 00:20:33,538
So there's nothing left for you to do
but support X!

260
00:20:40,381 --> 00:20:42,531
That's fine, Ghana,
but hurry up!

261
00:20:43,261 --> 00:20:45,172
You've almost reached the ground.

262
00:20:45,501 --> 00:20:47,492
Now we have to think about Zelda

263
00:20:47,541 --> 00:20:49,816
I'm glad that you're okay!

264
00:21:05,181 --> 00:21:08,218
Zelda! My daughter! My daughter!

265
00:21:08,261 --> 00:21:11,378
Don't die, dear!
My love! My little darling!

266
00:21:11,421 --> 00:21:13,537
Don't die, please!

267
00:21:14,341 --> 00:21:15,899
Zelda!

268
00:21:16,781 --> 00:21:20,012
Damn you! You'll pay
for what you've done!

269
00:21:20,901 --> 00:21:25,895
My wrath is terrible, Mr. X!

270
00:21:50,901 --> 00:21:53,335
Help! Help!

271
00:21:58,261 --> 00:22:00,616
Quite a fine job, dear!

272
00:22:00,661 --> 00:22:02,492
Now that you’re safe,
look at me too, Zelda!

273
00:22:02,541 --> 00:22:04,054
Mama!

274
00:22:07,661 --> 00:22:10,050
Hail Satan!

275
00:22:10,381 --> 00:22:14,613
Waters, seethe and break loose!

276
00:22:35,821 --> 00:22:40,212
Let’s flee! Help! Let’s run away! Help!

277
00:22:53,261 --> 00:22:55,092
They were truly stupid!

278
00:22:55,141 --> 00:22:57,939
Thus Satan and his
wife sacrificed their lives.

279
00:22:58,021 --> 00:23:00,012
Let’s retreat for now!

280
00:23:05,901 --> 00:23:07,698
Satan!

281
00:23:08,141 --> 00:23:12,259
You and your wife have
broken the law of the Great Devil!

282
00:23:13,421 --> 00:23:18,211
I will transform you respectively
into a mountain and into a lake!

283
00:23:19,221 --> 00:23:21,894
You will never be able to be demons again!

284
00:23:23,021 --> 00:23:24,739
Zelda!

285
00:23:24,781 --> 00:23:28,012
You are guilty
of having loved a human being,

286
00:23:28,741 --> 00:23:32,017
therefore I will punish you too!

287
00:23:32,621 --> 00:23:35,260
You can no longer be a demon.

288
00:23:35,661 --> 00:23:38,459
...and enjoy the privileges
of demons!

289
00:23:39,021 --> 00:23:42,730
From now on
you will be a poor mortal!

290
00:23:54,141 --> 00:23:57,895
Dad! Mom!

291
00:23:58,821 --> 00:24:01,335
Zelda, your parents
have made the rainbow...

292
00:24:01,381 --> 00:24:03,417
..to wish you happiness

293
00:24:05,621 --> 00:24:08,897
In this way, they are telling you to enter
the world of human beings...

294
00:24:08,941 --> 00:24:10,932
...and to live happily with Ghana.

295
00:24:10,981 --> 00:24:13,097
- Ghana!
- Zelda!

296
00:24:14,101 --> 00:24:15,819
Let's go, friends!

297
00:24:44,981 --> 00:24:48,601
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

298
00:24:48,602 --> 00:24:51,962
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

299
